  "boundary": "This plan prepares an exact-source, repository-local surface for a real assistive-technology review of the V1.6 Assistive technology acceptance lane and, when the reviewed findings also cover the required accessibility semantics, the remaining human-or-assistive-technology evidence group for Accessibility. The harness cannot hear, inspect, emulate, or certify a screen reader or other assistive technology, cannot create canonical evidence, and cannot promote lifecycle state. Qualifying evidence requires an actual reviewer-observed session using identified assistive technology on the frozen source, with environment, findings, limitations, and evidence references recorded separately."
